{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_cammou_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_cammou_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "無人工房",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cammou_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f2f6098f1259ee82c00ca75f177db7b21164429f033363513563d6a7b72803a0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "大家好！我是你們的老朋友，南希！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "還有你們的新朋友，卡達！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "欸？等等，卡達，別鬧啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "咳！在看完剛才那些影片後，相信大家已經對“無人廠房”有了一定的瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "傳聞說它之前是哥倫比亞某家醫藥公司的移動地塊，卻不知為何遭到荒廢。員工集體自殺，連老總也在繁華的特里蒙神秘失蹤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "不僅如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "雖然已經有不少有勇氣的探險者踏足這裡，但有新聞指出他們後來大多失蹤，回來的幾人也從此住進醫院，甚至無法與人交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "同時，更多人選擇相信另一版傳言——老總並不是失蹤，而是自殺！而深入“無人廠房”的人，都會遭到詛咒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "說到這裡，其實我已經覺得身上有些涼颼颼的了！不是我膽小，而是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "而是我們已經來到了“無人廠房”的所在地——大家請看，在我們身後不到五十米處，就是這個大名鼎鼎的廢棄地塊的入口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "那麼今天，我們將帶領大家探清“無人廠房”的真相，揭開超自然靈異現象的真正面目！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我是你們的新朋友，卡達！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "卡！完美！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "燈光！燈光！羅比，都說了你要時刻注意打光，我的臉拍好看了，就能一下子抓住觀眾眼球！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......這裡太恐怖了，我做不到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "還有卡達，你怎麼又突然蹦出來了？你真的是個第一次參與拍攝的新人嗎？像你這麼活潑的新人我還是第一次見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "這樣拍出來的影片才有意思嘛！要不然總是唸那些內容都差不多的介紹，我是觀眾我都點退出了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "行行行，開場什麼的都好說，進去之後可一定要按照腳本寫的來拍，好不好？這都是經過我深思熟慮寫出來的，不會錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "別跑啊！喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "羅比你記著進門那場一定要尖叫，叫完就往旁邊的石頭那邊倒，這樣鏡頭可以直接跟著你拍過去，直接就能引入我們要拍的下一場——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡達你拍完他尖叫，就往走廊深處走，這樣這個轉場就算拍成了——聽到沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "聽到啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "“別到時候播放量墊底，不僅沒面子，還會沒錢，沒錢就沒法拍下一個片子，就會更沒錢”，我都會背了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "隊長，要不把這句話當作開場白吧？我覺得會更有意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哎喲......哎喲......我感覺我又開始犯頭痛了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "不過，好像確實挺有意思的......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "測試，測試，有訊號嗎？能聽到我說話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗚！嚇我一跳！我要把聲音調小點......差點聾了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "能聽到，我開始拍了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "——大家好！我們現在已經進入了“無人廠房”的內部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "每人在探索的同時都會用手中的攝影機記錄我們所看到的一切，將最真實的情況傳遞給大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "我將從樓頂往下，卡達和羅比從一樓往上，我們一起出發，從兩個方向探索，在中間樓層會合，一起去感受“無人廠房”的詛咒......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "好了，你們也開始吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "唔，羅比，這裡有字呢，讓我看看寫了什麼......“別往裡面走，會死的。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "“真的有詛咒！”“救救我”“別回頭”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "快快快別說了......我們趕緊開始吧！讓我的注意力轉移到工作上來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那我也在這裡留個記號吧？就畫一個......比耶的我自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "咳咳，大家好，現現現在是七月十三號，淩晨十二點十五分，我們已經進入了“無人廠房”的內部，在一樓的大廳處......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "這裡面真的挺冷的。我記得之前有人就是在這拍了照，然後回去就瘋掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我們要不要也拍一張？然後記錄下我們拍完照之後的經歷，大家肯定好奇這個。來來來，我站在這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......一隻被泡脹了的羽獸......呃，標本？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "這東西為什麼會在這裡？這不是一個......廢棄的工廠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "這像是醫院才會有的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......還拍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "先、先不了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "好......但是，你有沒有聽到這裡一直有什麼聲音......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "聲音？我現在只聞到了這攤液體的臭味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "先......繼續錄吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人在空蕩蕩的大廳裡再次邁開腳步，奇怪的氣味刺激著鼻腔，讓這片區域變得奇怪起來。\n彷彿它已經獨立於外界，被什麼不該存在的東西浸透、包圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "跟隨著通道中不斷傳來的異響，我們來到了廠房一樓的深處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "在我們的兩邊各有一排房間，看起來已經很多年沒有人來過了。我們打開一扇門試試看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "呼——呼——好，我來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "噓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "......門自己開了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "剛才是你在敲門嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "不、不是我啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我也沒有......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "你你你別嚇我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（嚥口水）進去看一下......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我我我不敢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "那你跟在我後面？也和隊長同步一下我們的情況。拍得差不多，我們也可以往樓上走走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡達攥緊了手裡的攝影機。\n周圍太黑，她什麼也看不到，只能透過攝影機那一方小小的、綠瑩瑩的夜視螢幕，看到已經失去平常色彩的一小方走廊。\n一切都變得不真實了起來。她等待著隊友的回應。\n簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡達回頭，背後空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......羅比？你去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有回應。一聲重物落地的巨響傳來，隨後是彷彿野獸受傷後會發出的嗚咽。隱隱約約地，黑暗裡傳來爪子摩擦地面的聲音。\n簌、簌、簌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比？你在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......羅比，是你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡達接連跑過幾個空房間，眼前那一小片攝影機的夜視螢幕已經是她的全部視野。\n她不禁開始胡思亂想——\n要是......要是真的有什麼東西在黑暗裡，她能感知得到嗎？她能......躲得開嗎？\n......她的背後，真的，沒有人嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "我在這裡！快過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......羅比！你真的嚇死我了！不是說不要亂跑嗎？怎麼剛一轉身你就不見了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "呼......呼......還跑了這麼遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比？我沒看到你，你在哪？這裡太黑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "噗，還有好多灰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "快過來！我發現了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......我沒看到你啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡達重新舉起攝影機，不知為何，這才沒過多久，攝影機的電量已經告急。\n紅色的電量警告圖示不斷閃爍，映得四周忽明忽暗，彷彿人影憧憧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比，你揮揮手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我發現了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "前面隱約有光影晃動，像是那個羅比膽小又強撐著說腳本的樣子。\n卡達鬆了口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "你怎麼一個人跑了這麼遠？我還以為你太害怕，不敢一個人走呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......不會你那個害怕的樣子也是裝的吧？其實你一點也不害怕，但是為了影片好看......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "那......這種人設還挺不錯的，但是，那也不能這樣嚇我呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅比沒有回應。卡達伸手去拍他的肩膀。\n她確信那就是羅比。\n......等等，那真的是羅比嗎？\n咚！\n卡達的手重重地砸在一個堅硬的物體上。\n木架凌亂地散開，上面的破布無風卻微微飄蕩，熟悉的聲音再次傳來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我發現了——我發現了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀啦！\n聲音傳來的地方只有一團雜亂的電線，兩個紅色的訊號燈忽閃忽閃，停頓，隨即雜物下又傳出重複的聲音。\n“卡達！我在這裡，快過來，我發現了——”\n“我發現了——我發現了——”\n“我發現了——！！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比？羅比！......攝影機怎麼徹底沒電了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比？隊長？！對，隊長，我有通訊終端......隊長！你在哪？羅比不見了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "快接......快接啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......卡......不見......？羅......們在......點！......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡......快出......黑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "隊長！隊長？怎麼突然壞了......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "幾點了？......怎麼、怎麼還是十二點十五？！我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "怎麼又回到一樓了？我不是已經上了一層了嗎？啊，有可能這裡長得都一樣......對，可能二樓也長這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......這個怎麼是......比耶的我自己？......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "這裡......還是一樓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。\n攝影機裡突然傳出了聲音。卡達低頭看去：滿是雪花的螢幕中，羅比蒼白的臉上佈滿點點猩紅的傷口。\n隨即他無神地看向鏡頭，大叫起來——\n啊啊啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "完美！卡達，完美啊！這些素材足夠了，我們的影片一定能夠大紅，收工吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "剪輯的策劃案我已經寫好了，你要是有什麼小點子也可以加進去，加油加油，我們的目標是榜首！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......卡達？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（好可怕......我不要再想了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（我已經出來了......待會就能去房間裡抱著我的被子吃零食......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "門......門突然自己開了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "剛才是你在敲門嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "不、不是我啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......我也沒有......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（不對！不能再想了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（我出來了，我出來了，都是假的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“卡達！我在這裡，快過來，我發現了——”\n“我發現了——我發現了——”\n“我發現了！”\n簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（啊啊啊啊啊！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（到底是什麼一直在響啊！！難道當時真的有第三個人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡達？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "欸......欸......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "回神了回神了，等影片發出來，我請大家吃飯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "*哥倫比亞俚語*卡西米爾髒話**維多利亞方言**炎國粗口*——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......我發現他的時候，他就這樣了，還把樹當成了工廠裡一個嚇他的什麼東西，一直在追著打，那片樹林葉子都快掉光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "來吧，卡達。我們一起把影片剪出來，你不是一直想賺夠啟動資金自己拍影片嗎？等登到榜首，我還可以再資助你一筆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（......隊長看起來好鎮定，可是羅比已經嚇瘋了，我們去的不是同一個地方嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（我......我應該先剪影片，還是先安慰羅比，還是安慰安慰我自己啊！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "呵！......又被自己拍的影片嚇到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "能看清楚羅比究竟是被什麼嚇到了嗎？他現在都還沒回過神來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "看不出來......但他拍的這段真的很恐怖，又是抖動鏡頭又是喘氣聲的，還時不時拍到他自己的臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊，我不是說他長得恐怖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "但他臉上的傷口絕對不是自己能弄出來的，我還一直能聽到什麼窸窸窣窣的聲音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "等等！這裡要剪一個轉場，配上解說，從樓梯拍過來，然後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嗯嗯，調高一下亮度，把這些垃圾模糊掉，再把呼吸聲調大......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "門開、尖叫、樓梯追逐，這裡中斷一下，再轉我這邊的視角......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "隊長......你聽到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......聽、聽到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "這個聲音我也聽到過！在樓頂，我接到你的通訊，然後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "簌、簌、簌。\n明明已經回到了陽光下，但卡達覺得自己好像還身處於那個陰森的工廠。\n她湊近了螢幕——抖動的視角，混亂的背景音，還有羅比慌亂的喘氣聲。卡達拉高了亮度。\n兩個紅紅的小豆豆眼突然出現在影片的角落，直直地對上鏡頭，隨後湊了過來。\n簌、簌、簌。\n吱吱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "等等，什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "一隻鼷獸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "還這麼肥？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哪裡哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "就在那！看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "等等......怎麼這裡也有？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊！它它它撲到了羅比的臉上，狠狠地咬了他一頓！然後......然後......羅比丟下了攝影機，跳窗戶逃走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "讓我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "等下等下，這裡也有！這麼多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......難道這工廠其實是個......鼷獸窩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "怎麼可能！那裡當時發生那麼多事情，沒人敲門但又有聲音，門還會自己打開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比的攝影機還會自己重複播放影片！我一直上不去二樓，時間也停止了！我不管怎麼走都是十二點十五，在一樓繞圈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......我、我要自己看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡達拉動進度條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我還和你失去了通訊呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......是它在通訊基地台上尿尿導致了基地台短路？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "那......那我一直在一樓爬不上去呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......是它在樓梯上做窩，把樓梯咬穿了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "時間一直是十二點十五，也是它搞壞了我的手錶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼷獸",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "吱吱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗯？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "臭東西，被我看到了吧！哈哈哈，我羅比勇士今天就和你拼了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼷獸",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（愉快地跑走）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "別跑——呀——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "隊長！難道根本就沒有什麼搞不懂的靈異事件，都是這隻、這隻肥肥鼷獸搞出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "......全都是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......什麼啊......鼷獸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "不過、不過、要是影片裡真的就這樣把真相說出來，這個影片不會好看的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "預告已經放出去了，大家都在期待一個恐怖工廠的探險，要嘛自己被嚇，要嘛看我們被嚇。一隻鼷獸？這太沒勁了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "那......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "還是按之前討論的那樣剪吧，一個純粹的恐怖影片，這隻鼷獸出現的鏡頭都剪掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "就像你模糊掉的那些垃圾一樣，這種鏡頭出現在影片裡，只會讓這個影片看起來太過真實，沒人要看這些的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "多看看預告片裡觀眾們在意的點，他們想看什麼，我們就做什麼，不會出錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "怎麼，你不太願意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡達，終於！你看起來像個拍攝新人了！你是不是覺得這是在欺騙觀眾？來，聽姐姐給你講講，這其實不是欺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我很支持這樣做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我覺得這是很好的點子啊！大家肯定都喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "——點......子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "還想把我做成點心？你羅比爺爺一拳把你這個臭東西打翻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "等等，羅比，那是石頭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "怎麼樣，隊長，還有哪裡需要修改的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "沒有了？那我就——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "羅比！你還好嗎？我要點上傳啦——三、二、一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "來了來了，刷新，刷新，我要看評論！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......點擊量上來了！評論怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "評論區還沒有什麼，大家估計都還在看，但是讚數漲得很快，這才過一下已經有一千多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "現在榜首的影片播放量是三萬，我們的已經五千了......八千了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "評論多起來了！“我和那個小哥一起尖叫起來了！”“我不敢看！誰能告訴我門後到底是啥？”“每次換鏡頭我的心臟都會停止跳動！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哦，我的朋友已經發訊息問我了，看起來他們很羡慕嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "等等......播放量已經一萬了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "一萬五......兩萬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "三萬、三萬、三萬......拜託了！讓我登上一次榜首吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "稍等，我刷新一下，有可能有延遲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "唔，好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "增長速度慢下來了......兩萬五。等等再看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嗯嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "兩萬五千三......兩萬五千五......兩萬五千五百三十二......卡住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "隊長，第二名也很厲害啦！我們才剛上傳不是嗎？等到晚上說不定就第一了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "你看現在的榜首，其實就是一個人笑眯眯地在小吃街上走走吃吃，稿子除了驚呼就是“真好吃，大家快來吧”，我們肯定能比過它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "你搶了我的台詞了，小丫頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "應該是我安慰你才對啊。不過第一次拍攝就能有這樣的成績，你現在應該四處炫耀才對啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "來吧，辛苦了一天一夜了，我去把吃的都拿過來？忙了這麼久，都快餓扁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "披薩還是蜜餅，或者你想不想來點風乾烤肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "我要啤酒！我要喝醉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "哈哈哈！我要烤這個工廠來吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "什麼，他還沒有醒過來啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩天後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "唉，兩天了，我們的影片還是第二，怎麼就差......就差幾百播放量，就是上不去呢！難道我們真的比不過那個逛街吃飯歡呼影片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "這次收益不夠的話，不僅下個月的伙食費沒了，卡達的啟動資金可能又要多賺幾個月......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "而且，我怎麼聞到一股燒焦味......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "咳咳！咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "呼——！怎麼這麼大的煙？我們的設備都怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡達？羅比？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "沒事！沒事！只是影片的評論太多，有點超載！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "評論太多？我們的影片不是已經停在第二了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "等等等等，現在的榜首是什麼？《最終的真相揭示之靈異無人工廠》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "這個影片裡的地方和我們去的地方好像......不對，這就是我們的影片！我都聽到羅比的聲音了！而且......它剪的全都是有鼷獸的片段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "卡達？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "猜猜是誰剪的這個新影片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "快看快看！探險影片的播放量漲了！大家看了這個解密影片，已經開始對應著看探險版本了！即時評論裡全都在找鼷獸在哪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "哇，我們的探險影片是榜首了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "解密影片現在是第二！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "（得意洋洋地晃了晃因為評論區被刷爆而冒煙的終端）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡達",
      "speakerId": "avg_328_cammou_1",
      "text": "我們現在把那個逛吃影片比下去囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "text": "天哪，卡達！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在裊裊的黑煙中，羅比打了兩個超大的噴嚏。\n彷彿大夢初醒般，他鬆開了自己剛剛還在毆打著的折疊椅，捧起了終端，看到了播放量居然已經突破了五萬的自己的影片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "嗚哇——哇——！榜首？榜首——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "卡達小姐！我是在做夢嗎？還是說，在工廠裡的時候就死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "這裡是哥倫比亞，還是玻利瓦爾啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隊友們把腦袋湊到終端前，看到探險影片和解密影片互相爭奪著榜首，播放量一路往上衝。\n後台發來提醒，兩支影片的收益數字一路彈跳著，帶著終端冒出了更多的黑煙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拍攝燈光師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "耶——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
